"30693","The Sports Mall","Aaron Behar","4710 Eisenhower Blvd. S. Suite A1","Tampa","FL","33634","USA","800.793.9793","aaron@thesportsmall.com","","Sports memorabilia pricingvery simple pricing structure. FR lite is probably a better option for them ","script firedConcerns: production flow, inventory mgnt.","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","We welcome you to SportsCollectibles.com, your one stop shop for authentic sports memorabilia and sports collectibles. Our upstart website offers over 500k authenticated items from the National Football League, NCAA Football & Basketball, Major league Baseball, National Basketball Association, National Hockey League, PGA Tour and more. Our fast-growing brand is recognizable in the sports memorabilia industry and is synonymous with excellence, authenticity and great value. Our always growing, diverse collection of sports memorabilia makes it easy to find the exact sports item you are shopping for. We have a major online and social presence in the memorabilia world. SportsCollectibles.com's most popular items are autograph baseballs, autographed authentic helmets, framed sports jerseys, signed NFL footballs and autographed pro jerseys. The best way to protect your new piece of sports memorabilia is to add a football, helmet or baseball display case. Display cases add value to your collectible and protect it for years to come. All of our signed products will come with a Sports Collectibles Certificate of Authenticity. The COA includes a hologram with serial number on your item and a matching hologram with serial number on a Certificate. Sports Collectibles also offers a 100% Money Back Guarantee on all of our items. Throughout the year we host autograph signings with the biggest names in sports. We have conducted autograph signings with Urban Meyer, Luke Kuechly, Nick Chubb, Pete Rose, Baker Mayfield, Patrick Mahomes and many more. SportsCollectibles.com has Dwayne Haskins, Eddie George and two-time Heisman Trophy winner, Archie Griffin as an exclusive client. Our top selling athletes and coaches are Bobby Bowden, Nick Saban, Aaron Rodgers, Drew Brees, Ezekiel Elliott, Saquon Barkley and Ronald Acuna Jr. Our staff has held autograph signings with Clemson National Champions Christian Wilkins, Dexter Lawrence, Kendall Joseph and other Clemson Champions. SportsCollectibles.com has an exclusive contract for in-stadium auctions with Florida State, Georgia, Florida and Alabama football. Calling in to our offices will get you the best price online. Our best-selling baseball products are Pete Rose signed baseballs, Ronald Acuna autographed jerseys and Chicago Cubs memorabilia.","02/08/2023","","",""
